Error [jet.ProgramEntryMixed]: Top-level statements at `program_entry_mixed_same_file.jet:2` and `run: fn` at `program_entry_mixed_same_file.jet:4` are two entries of one program
  --> Tests/UI/program_entry_mixed_same_file.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | print("before")
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A program is script style, its entry file's top-level statements, or one `run: fn`, never both, so it starts in one place
 Fix: Move the statements into `run: fn`, or remove `run: fn` so the statements run
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0621
